# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored). Values here are Worker bindings for `wrangler dev` only.
# They do NOT change which Cloudflare account wrangler deploys to.
# Deploy ONLY with your own deploy script (for example ~/path/to/deploy.sh) that refuses unless this project's
# Cloudflare account id and token are set, so a global wrangler login is never used.
